se (a `<header>` row that spaces its contents apart)."],[682,"**`icon.content`**: Overrides the BentoIllustration component - affects SVG transformations (rotate, flip), accessibility attributes (`role`, `focusable`, `aria-labelledby`), viewBox calculations, and final SVG element rendering"],[681,"**`icon`**: Overrides the entire BentoIcon component - affects icon loading, caching, sprite/SVG mode switching, data attributes, and the overall icon wrapper"],[689,"**`ondemand(loader)`**: Register an asynchronous icon loader (returns unregister function)"],[690,"**`parser(svgString)`**: Parse SVG strings into React elements"],[688,"**`set(icons)`**: Synchronously add icons to the store"],[1554,"**`size` is the tier.** The eyebrow reads it on the `detail` ramp, the title on `heading`, and\nthe body on `body`, so there is no table to memorize. Without `size`, the lockup follows the\nsurrounding size scope. A tier is the same at every container width."],[1127,"**A step isn't clickable:** it has no `onPress`, so it's inert by design. Add `onPress` to make it interactive."],[670,"**Accessibility ready**: Built-in support for screen readers and keyboard navigation"],[218,"**Accessibility ready**: Keyboard navigation, screen reader support, and semantic HTML"],[674,"**Accessibility**: `aria-label`, `aria-describedby`, `role`, `title`"],[1380,"**Adopted** - inside a parent that provides its context (e.g. `Modal`), it picks up that parent's styling and spacing automatically. Consumer props still win over the adopted defaults."],[1518,"**Adornments**: Fixed text or icons before or after the input (e.g. `$`, `.00`, `px`) are composed inside `Group`, positioned by source order"],[1552,"**An explicit prop on a child always wins** over what the lockup supplies. Pass\n`<Tag slot=\"eyebrow\" size=\"sm\">` to break the pairing, for instance."],[1160,"**Arrow Down/Right**: Move to next radio button"],[1282,"**Arrow Left/Right**: Move to next/previous segment"],[933,"**Arrow Right/Left**: