for seamless theme integration"],[1517,"**Composable interior**: Compose `Label`, `Input` or `TextArea`, `Text slot=\"description\"`, and `FieldError`. Omitting `Group` leaves the control as a direct field child with box chrome. Use an explicit `Group` for controls or adornments"],[526,"**Composable interior**: Compose `Label`, a `Button slot=\"trigger\"`, `DatePickerCalendar`, and optional `Text` / `FieldError`. Nothing is added for you, and what you write keeps the order you wrote it in. `children` also accepts a function for picker state"],[1304,"**Composable interior**: Compose `Label`, a `Button slot=\"trigger\"`, `SelectOptions`, and optional `Text` / `FieldError`. Nothing is added for you, and what you write keeps the order you wrote it in"],[991,"**Composable interior**: Compose `Label`, the control, `Text slot=\"description\"`, and `FieldError`. Nothing is added for you, and what you write keeps the order you wrote it in"],[1306,"**Composed in another field**: Use `variant=\"control\"` to sit inside another field's `Group`, as a country-code select beside a phone `Input`"],[900,"**Composes into other components**: `Select` uses `ListBox` internally; reach for `ListBox` directly when you need an inline list rather than a popover dropdown."],[740,"**Consider preloading** frequently used icons to reduce loading delays"],[898,"**Controlled or uncontrolled**: Use `selectedKeys` and `onSelectionChange` for controlled state, or `defaultSelectedKeys` for uncontrolled."],[995,"**Controlled or uncontrolled**: Use `value` and `onChange` for controlled state, or `defaultValue` for uncontrolled"],[1308,"**Controlled or uncontrolled**: Use `value` and `onChange` for controlled state, or `defaultValue` for uncontrolled"],[1520,"**Controlled or uncontrolled**: Use `value` and `onChange` for controlled state, or `defaultValue` for uncontrolled"],[1553,"**Controls keep the scale size.** A `Button` inside a lockup follows the surrounding\n`SizeProvider` or its own `size` prop, never the lockup's tier."],[1519,"**Controls**: A `Button slot=\"control\"` beside the input is an interactive affix; it picks up field chrome from context"],[836,"**Custom Components:** When using `as={MyComponent}`, Box accepts that component's props. If there's a prop name conflict, Box's props take priority."],[216,"**Custom domains**: Set explicit x and y ranges for controlled scales across multiple charts"],[215,"**Customizable axes**: Control gridlines, tick marks, axis titles, and tick formatting"],[271,"**Debounce resize**: The default 15ms debounce on `useParentSize` balances smoothness and performance"],[728,"**Deduplication**: Icon path data only exists once in the sprite sheet, regardless of how many times it's used"],[213,"**Design system alignment**: 8px border radius, 12px bar width (1.5 GU), consistent spacing"],[730,"**DOM Output:**"],[675,"**Events**: `onClick`, `onMouseOver`, `onFocus`, etc."],[1548,"**Every part names its role with a slot**: `eyebrow`, `title`, `body`. Unslotted text follows\nthe lockup's tier too: a bare `Heading` takes the title tier and a bare `Text` the body tier."],[746,"**Fallback content**: Provide placeholder content for loading states"],[734,"**Faster Rendering**: Browser optimizations for `<use>` elements"],[719,"**First Request**: When an icon is first encountered, it triggers an asynchronous fetch from the CDN"],[668,"**Flexible sizing**: Support for `width` and `height` props"],[1311,"**Form integration**: Set `name` and the value submits as part of a native `<form>` (multiple values submit as repeated entries)"],[722,"**Full SVG Rendering**: Each icon instance renders as a complete SVG element with all path data"],[230,"**Group gap**: Minimum 24px between bar groups"],[242,"**Grouped rendering**: Bars are rendered in SVG `<Group>` elements for logical organization"],[245,"**Horizontal charts**: Vertical scrolling when many categories exceed container height"],[234,"**Horizontal scrolling**: When data points exceed available width, the chart becomes horizontally scrollable"],[835,"**HTML Elements:** When using `as=\"button\"`, TypeScript enforces button-specific props like `type`, `disabled`, and `onClick`."],[826,"**Important**: Since `Flex` and `Grid` extend `Box`, prefer them for layouts. Use `Box` only when you need a non-flex, non-grid container."],[697,"**Important**: When you supply a `className`, you make a commitment to take over all styling of the component as it will remove the standard class names. Use data attributes for targeted styling instead."],[737,"**Initial Flash**: Brief moment where icons appear/disappear during sprite injection"],[214,"**Interactive tooltips**: Hover to see exact values, with smart positioning and scroll-awareness"],[368,"**isInvalid**: Shows error state styling"],[367,"**isRequired**: Marks the group as required with visual indicator"],[237,"**Keyboard navigation**: Bar groups are keyboard accessible with `tabIndex={0}` and `role=\"group\"`"],[899,"**Layout primitive**: `ListBox` and `ListBoxItem` accept layout props (`gap`, `padding`, etc.) — they extend `FlexOwnProps`."],[1631,"**Left** — when the group controls content directly below or within the same column (dashboards, tables)."],[270,"**Limit data points**: Consider pagination or filtering for very large datasets (>100 points)"],[733,"**Lower Memory Usage**: Especially beneficial with many repeated icons"],[232,"**Margins**: 20px top/right, 60px bottom/left for axes and labels"],[750,"**Minimize icon sets**: Only load icons that are actually used"],[236,"**Minimum spacing**: Group gaps never fall below 24px, triggering scroll instead"],[1521,"**Multiline**: Compose a `TextArea` instead of an `Input` for multiline entry"],[744,"**Network connectivity**: Verify CDN is accessible"],[1126,"**No step is highlighted:** `currentStep` is omitted, negative, or out of range. Set it to the active step's 0-based index."],[666,"**On-demand loading**: Icons are loaded asynchronously from CDN only when needed"],[731,"**Performance Benefits:**"],[748,"**Preload common icons**: Consider preloading frequently used icons"],[741,"**Provide fallback content** for critical icons to handle loading states"],[1157,"**Radio Button:** `data-selected`, `data-hovered`, `data-pressed`, `data-focused`, `data-disabled`"],[1156,"**RadioGroup Container:** `data-invalid`, `data-disabled`, `data-required`, `data-readonly`, `data-orientation`"],[901,"**React Aria integration**: Built on React Aria ListBox for accessibility, keyboard navigation, and typeahead."],[1312,"**React Aria integration**: Built on React Aria Select for accessibility, keyboard navigation, and typeahead"],[855,"**Recommended default**: Use `Flex` for most layouts. Since it extends `Box`, you get all `Box` capabilities without needing to nest components."],[732,"**Reduced DOM Size**: Path data stored once instead of duplicated"],[727,"**Reference Rendering**: Each icon renders as a lightweight `<use>` element that references the sprite"],[212,"**Responsive behavior**: Auto-sizing with horizontal scrolling for many data points, sticky axes"],[243,"**Responsive sizing**: `useParentSize` hook provides efficient resize detection with debouncing (15ms)"],[1633,"**Right** — when the group represents utility or contextual controls (e.g. grid/list view toggle)."],[217,"**RTL support**: Full right-to-left layout support for international audiences _(in development)_"],[241,"**Scales**: VisX's `scaleBand` and `scaleLinear` for efficient coordinate mapping"],[238,"**Screen reader support**: Semantic HTML structure with proper ARIA attributes"],[1279,"**SegmentedController Container:** `data-disabled`"],[1280,"**SegmentedControllerItem:** `data-selected`, `data-hovered`, `data-pressed`, `data-focus-visible`, `data-disabled`"],[1371,"**Shared structural containers.** These generic, layout-only components are the building blocks for composing a component's interior (a `Modal`, a card, a panel). They are semantic containers built on `Flex`, so they accept the same layout props (`direction`, `gap`, `alignItems`, `justifyContent`, `padding`, ...)."],[373,"**Shift + Tab**: Moves focus to the previous checkbox"],[272,"**Simplify tooltips**: If tooltips are complex, consider using simpler content or disabling them"],[210,"**Single and multi-series support**: Display one or multiple data series with grouped bars"],[1307,"**Single or multiple selection**: Set `selectionMode=\"multiple\"` to allow multiple values"],[897,"**Single or multiple selection**: Set `selectionMode=\"single\"` or `\"multiple\"`."],[528,"**Sizes**: Each picker is a `SizeProvider`. `size` (`sm`, `md`, `lg`) sets its label, trigger, description, error, and the calendar it opens; without it, the picker follows the surrounding scope"],[1523,"**Sizes**: The field is a `SizeProvider`. `size` (`sm`, `md`, `lg`) sets its label, input, description, error, and composed controls; without it, the field follows the surrounding scope. An explicit `size` on a part still wins for that part"],[993,"**Sizes**: The field is a `SizeProvider`. `size` (`sm`, `md`, `lg`) sets its label, input, steppers, description, and error; without it, the field follows the surrounding scope"],[1310,"**Sizes**: The field is a `SizeProvider`. `size` (`sm`, `md`, `lg`) sets the label, trigger, and options, which open at the same size even though they render in a portal. Without it, the Select follows the surrounding scope"],[1162,"**Space**: Select the focused radio button"],[372,"**Space**: Toggles the focused checkbox"],[931,"**Space/Enter**: activate an item; **Escape**: close"],[1283,"**Space/Enter**: Select the focused segment"],[726,"**Sprite Sheet Creation**: A hidden SVG sprite sheet is automatically injected into the DOM containing symbol definitions"],[736,"**SSR Limitation**: Sprite references render empty until client-side hydration"],[1379,"**Standalone** - with no parent context it renders with its own structural defaults and looks the sa